Twemoji
=======

The emoji graphics in this directory (1f525.svg "fire", 1f442.svg "ear") are
from the Twemoji project.

Copyright 2020 Twitter, Inc and other contributors.

Graphics licensed under CC-BY 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Source: https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji (maintained fork of twitter/twemoji)

These SVGs are vendored and embedded (as data URIs) into the server-rendered
Satori share card via satori's `graphemeImages` option so that 🔥 and 👂 render
in full color, matching the in-app UI.
